          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆ — mārukaṭṭe — \"a marketplace; a market\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಭಾನುವಾರ ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಜನ ಇರುತ್ತಾರೆ. bhānuvāra mārukaṭṭeyalli tumbā jana iruttāre. On Sundays there are a lot of people in the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂತೆ is a weekly fair; ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆ (mārukaṭṭe) is a standing market."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆ (mārukaṭṭe) is a native Kannada compound of māṟu, \"to sell, to barter\" (DEDR 4834), and ಕಟ್ಟೆ, \"a raised platform\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
