              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೇಟೆ — pēṭe — \"a bazaar; a market street\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಳೆಯ ಪೇಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬಟ್ಟೆ ಅಗ್ಗವಾಗಿ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ. haḷeya pēṭeyalli baṭṭe aggavāgi siguttade. Cloth is cheap in the old bazaar."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the market quarter of a town: ಪೇಟೆಗೆ ಹೋಗು, to go into town."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೇಟೆ (pēṭe) is a Kannada word for a market street whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
