              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಂಡುಕೊ — koṇḍuko — \"to buy for oneself; to purchase\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಾನು ಮಾರುಕಟ್ಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹೊಸ ಚಪ್ಪಲಿ ಕೊಂಡುಕೊಂಡೆ. nānu mārukaṭṭeyalli hosa cappali koṇḍukoṇḍe. I bought new sandals at the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಕೊಂಡುಕೊಂಡೆ, koṇḍukoṇḍe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಂಡು is the past stem of ಕೊಳ್ಳು, to take or buy; ಕೊ adds for oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
