          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಂಡುಕೊ (koṇḍuko) is native Dravidian: koṇḍu, the past stem of koḷ, koḷḷu, \"to take, to obtain, to buy\" (DEDR 2151), with the reflexive -ko."
            }
